    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Born a Missouri farm girl in 1863 and lured away by a @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.GaCuLGcjZZjf2EO6]{Toreador} dance partner who Embraced her only to abandon her six months later as \"mundane,\" Lucina has spent her unlife trying to prove her sire wrong. She leads Milwaukee's Toreador (loosely; they are notoriously fickle), holds a seat on the Council of Elders, and has appointed herself guardian of the city's museums, concert halls, and cultural institutions against Anarch vandalism &mdash; her ghouls guard these sites around the clock. She despises Sir Edward Scott and the Anarchs as a matter of principle, generally allies with Gracis Nostinus in Council votes, and dreams of reforming the Toreador Clan into a genuine force for art and beauty rather than hedonism.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Sweet, demure, and girlish on the surface &mdash; she still appears to be a teenager. Lash out suddenly and fiercely at anyone who crosses her on a matter she cares about; her innocent facade hides real fanaticism and power.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Hansen. Haven: a permanent room on the 16th floor of the Hyatt Regency. Disciplines as printed: Auspex 4, Celerity 2, Presence 4, Protean 3 (capped above to this system's 1-5 scale). Close ally of Barth the DJ and Louis Detonas.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
